{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-13-3","kind":"proposition","title":"大小比较：黄金分割与平方与比例","englishTitle":"If a straight line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, the square on the lesser segment added to the half of the greater segment is five times the square on the half of the greater segment.","book":13,"number":3,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.3","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.3/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":3,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","contentId":"euclid-13-3","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3fd9f0e8566f3fd15c1eed12f489abf6b1e2f894305a64acaf5c27e52a0e92ba","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-13-3.statement","euclid-13-3.construction.1","euclid-13-3.construction.2","euclid-13-3.proof.1","euclid-13-3.proof.2","euclid-13-3.proof.3","euclid-13-3.proof.4","euclid-13-3.proof.5","euclid-13-3.proof.6","euclid-13-3.proof.7","euclid-13-3.construction.3","euclid-13-3.proof.8","euclid-13-3.proof.9","euclid-13-3.proof.10","euclid-13-3.proof.11","euclid-13-3.conclusion","euclid-13-3.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-13-3.statement","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed2f84f3c4e3ebabf56f7af1caadf43ce8b62072f78677eea9a1f8c47fa5ab65","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a straight line be cut in extreme and mean ratio, the square on the lesser segment added to the half of the greater segment is five times the square on the half of the greater segment."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在黄金分割削减直线,则较大数量部分的一半增加的较小部分的正方形是较大数量部分的正方形的5倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"758948c14d4cbe67a0f2d2192ef04d48198ba5829153bfc81abe7e151780ef54","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let any straight line AB be cut in extreme and mean ratio at the point C, let AC be the greater segment, and let AC be bisected at D; I say that the square on BD is five times the square on DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果在黄金分割的C点将任何直线AB线切开,那么AC线是较大的数量部分,AC线是D线的两部分;我说,BD线的正方形是DC线的正方形的五倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"11ca3c461038f4c3d354e0fefea3bccc8d0f214836c07dd79dd8f7315fbe4311","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the square AE be described on AB, and let the figure be drawn double."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将正方形 AE的描述放在AB上,并加倍计算。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4dde769ff8bc5fb44485f2157226a4700588efcef1a3d06b0b89f21a965aacf0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since AC is double of DC, therefore the square on AC is quadruple of the square on DC, that is, RS is quadruple of FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AC是DC的两倍,因此,AC的正方形是DC的三倍,即RS是FG的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0ea298a9585b835239370ade4f68da8f8a2a392d1d3be00118e6b2dd314d576c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since the rectangle AB, BC is equal to the square on AC, and CE is the rectangle AB, BC, therefore CE is equal to RS."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AB,BC等于AC的正方形,CE等于矩形,BC等于AB,BC,CE等于RS。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fd15ba3c5e3eef973caa2c682b1e110e31da8b5eac2e4a992b029eccd88bb13b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But RS is quadruple of FG; therefore CE is also quadruple of FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但RS是FG的三倍,因此CE也是FG的三倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"96092d3e63fadc36920889b7ca959ad8b06761a14d5729115b1126d6424113ac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since AD is equal to DC, HK is also equal to KF."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于AD等于DC,HK等于KF。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"501dab35d19908784ab2475da3b6df9e6058782b8aabe4da485d4d4aa9e42e2b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence the square GF is also equal to the square HL."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,正方形 GF也等于正方形 HL。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1fe75d42951f6163ae976004e5afd9b20d547d9b5e407bcbaa4b4ce813b33bda","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore GK is equal to KL, that is, MN to NE; hence MF is also equal to FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,GK等于KL,即MN至NE;MF也等于FE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3faf356d18cc79918e2dba3f0928936e706c919232a0bfd8b25f54f8e0f7600e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But MF is equal to CG; therefore CG is also equal to FE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但MF等于CG,因此CG也等于FE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"90a199005256e7573accea56d49e2129fdbe6a2bb9959cf2516f1b172b7e8a0e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let CN be added to each; therefore the gnomon OPQ is equal to CE."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每人加CN,曲尺形 OPQ等于CE。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1a2c0eb9fc9266acb4bf94a276ba87565ef9282ce394bc0c5aad45b9bd1d53f9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But CE was proved quadruple of GF; therefore the gnomon OPQ is also quadruple of the square FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但CE被证明是GF的三倍;因此,曲尺形OPQ也是正方形 FG的四倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eecda8d1dc7b53414f575891afbb2bcd3b90d6355c33f6d7b89218a895b61b36","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the gnomon OPQ and the square FG are five times FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,曲尺形 OPQ和正方形 FG是5乘以FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6ef445e355bc4281a3acc0a8f8c8de18f2887cbe82942066f862d175e3e1b89f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the gnomon OPQ and the square FG are the square DN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是曲尺形 OPQ和正方形 FG是正方形 DN"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae0099076e5f338d79abf48a19e33febc0676d04df4484150c64fbf1ca1b67e5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And DN is the square on DB, and GF the square on DC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"DN是DB正方形 GF是DNDC"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":15,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b3717f394ef678d822ba677de0982dc57056d24645f9708a8be3d5f8c53e6446","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the square on DB is five times the square on DC. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,DB的正方形是DC的正方形的5倍,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-13-3.source","contentId":"euclid-13-3","revisionId":"euclid-13-3@raw-3fd9f0e8566f3fd1","order":16,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"38169c71a8927faed9ad85e478f935e21b2406a80e2502cda4dccd0fec888da7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.3/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.3\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[],"incomingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-13-16:euclid-13-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-13-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-13-16.proof.35"],"targetContentId":"euclid-13-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:13.prop.16/","sourceLabel":"XIII. 3"}}],"dependencies":[],"dependents":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-13-16:euclid-13-3:explicit","id":"euclid-13-16","book":13,"number":16,"kind":"proposition","title":"作内接于球的正二十面体","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-ratio","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
